<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tạo đơn xin nghỉ - Present Portal</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 & Bootstrap Icons -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        /* Reset & premium fonts */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #e5e5ea; border-radius: 10px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #c1c1c4; }

        body {
            background-color: #faf9f5;
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .text-orange { color: #8c7b45 !important; }
        .bg-orange { background-color: #F3E6B3 !important; }
        
        .btn-orange {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F3E6B3 0%, #e2d39d 100%);
            color: #3d3516;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-orange:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e2d39d 0%, #d1c18c 100%);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.5);
            color: #241f0b;
        }

        .wrapper { display: flex; width: 100%; align-items: stretch; }

        /* Premium Sidebar */
        #sidebar {
            min-width: 260px;
            max-width: 260px;
            background: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: fixed;
            box-shadow: 4px 0 24px rgba(140, 123, 69, 0.02);
            z-index: 10;
        }
        
        .sidebar-header { padding: 30px 24px; }
        
        .nav-link {
            color: #515154;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 4px 16px;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .nav-link i { margin-right: 12px; font-size: 1.2rem; vertical-align: text-bottom;}
        .nav-link:hover { background: rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.12); color: #8c7b45; }
        
        .nav-link.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F3E6B3 0%, #e2d39d 100%);
            color: #3d3516;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.3);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .sidebar-heading {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #9e9e9f;
            padding-left: 24px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .sidebar-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
        }

        /* Content spacing */
        #content {
            width: calc(100% - 260px);
            margin-left: 260px;
            padding: 40px 50px;
        }

        /* Form Card */
        .content-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(140, 123, 69, 0.04);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(140, 123, 69, 0.02);
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .form-label-custom {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #86868b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }

        .form-control-custom, .form-select-custom {
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5ea;
            background-color: #fafafc;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .form-control-custom:focus, .form-select-custom:focus {
            border-color: #d9cc9c;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.35);
            outline: none;
        }

        .notice-card {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #faf8f0, #ffffff);
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.25);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(140, 123, 69, 0.02);
            padding: 35px;
        }
        
        .input-group-text-custom {
            background-color: #fafafc;
            border-color: #e5e5ea;
            border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px !important;
            padding: 12px 18px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            #sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); position: fixed; }
            #content { width: 100%; margin-left: 0; padding: 30px 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <nav id="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header d-flex align-items-center mb-2">
            <div class="bg-orange rounded-3 p-2 me-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center shadow-sm" style="width: 40px; height: 40px;">
                <i class="bi bi-buildings text-dark fs-5"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold text-dark" style="letter-spacing: -0.5px;">Present</h5>
                <small class="text-muted fw-medium" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">Hệ thống Nhân sự</small>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="nav flex-column mt-2">
            <li class="nav-item"><a href="/dashboard" class="nav-link"><i class="bi bi-grid-1x2-fill"></i> Tổng quan</a></li>
            <div class="sidebar-heading">CÁ NHÂN</div>
            <li class="nav-item"><a href="/bang-luong" class="nav-link"><i class="bi bi-cash-stack"></i> Phiếu lương</a></li>
            <div class="sidebar-heading">QUẢN LÝ ĐƠN TỪ</div>
            <li class="nav-item"><a href="/tao-don" class="nav-link active"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i> Tạo đơn xin nghỉ</a></li>
            <li class="nav-item"><a href="/lich-su-nghi" class="nav-link"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i> Lịch sử đơn từ</a></li>

            <% if (user.ma_chuc_vu === 1 || user.ma_chuc_vu === 2) { %>
                <div class="sidebar-heading">QUẢN TRỊ VIÊN</div>
                <li class="nav-item"><a href="/duyet-don" class="nav-link"><i class="bi bi-check2-square"></i> Duyệt đơn</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a href="/quan-ly-nhan-su" class="nav-link"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> Hồ sơ Nhân sự</a></li>
            <% } %>
        </ul>

        <div class="sidebar-footer">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4 px-2">
                <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=<%= user.ho_ten %>&background=F3E6B3&color=1d1d1f&rounded=true" alt="Avatar" width="40" height="40" class="me-3 shadow-sm rounded-circle">
                <div style="overflow: hidden;">
                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.9rem;"><%= user.ho_ten %></h6>
                    <small class="text-muted text-truncate d-block" style="font-size: 0.8rem;"><%= user.email %></small>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a href="/dang-xuat" class="btn btn-light w-100 fw-semibold" style="color: #ff3b30; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff5f5; border: none; padding: 10px;"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i>Đăng xuất</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div id="content">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-5">
            <div>
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.8px;">Tạo đơn xin nghỉ</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Vui lòng điền đầy đủ thông tin để quản lý tiện sắp xếp công việc</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <!-- Left: Form -->
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="content-card">
                    <form action="/xu-ly-tao-don" method="POST">
                        <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label-custom">Loại nghỉ phép <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-custom w-100" name="loai_nghi" required>
                                    <option value="" selected disabled>-- Chọn phân loại --</option>
                                    <option value="Phép năm">Nghỉ phép năm (Có lương)</option>
                                    <option value="Nghỉ ốm">Nghỉ ốm (Có giấy khám)</option>
                                    <option value="Việc riêng">Nghỉ việc riêng (Không lương)</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label-custom">Nhân sự bàn giao <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <div class="input-group">
                                    <span class="input-group-text input-group-text-custom"><i class="bi bi-person text-muted"></i></span>
                                    <select class="form-select form-select-custom ps-0" style="border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; border-left: none; font-weight: 500;" name="nguoi_ban_giao" required>
                                        <option value="" selected disabled>-- Chọn người nhận bàn giao --</option>
                                        <% if (typeof danhSachNhanVien !== 'undefined') { %>
                                            <% danhSachNhanVien.forEach(function(nv) { %>
                                                <option value="<%= nv.ho_ten %>"><%= nv.ho_ten %> (<%= nv.email %>)</option>
                                            <% }); %>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label-custom">Từ ngày <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-custom w-100" name="ngay_bat_dau" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label-custom">Đến ngày <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-custom w-100" name="ngay_ket_thuc" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-5">
                            <label class="form-label-custom">Lý do chi tiết <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <textarea class="form-control form-control-custom w-100" name="ly_do" rows="4" placeholder="Viết rõ lý do vắng mặt của bạn tại đây..." required></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-3 pt-3 border-top" style="border-color: #f0ede4 !important;">
                            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-light fw-bold px-4" style="border-radius: 12px; color: #515154; background: #f5f5f7; border: none; padding: 12px 24px;">Hủy bỏ</a>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-orange shadow-sm"><i class="bi bi-send-fill me-2"></i>Gửi đơn duyệt</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Notice Card -->
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="notice-card h-100">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="bg-orange rounded-circle d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center me-3 shadow-sm" style="width: 45px; height: 45px;">
                            <i class="bi bi-info-lg text-dark fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Lưu ý quan trọng</h5>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mb-4 p-3 rounded-4" style="background: rgba(243, 230, 179, 0.2);">
                        <div class="text-orange fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Quỹ phép khả dụng</div>
                        <div class="fs-2 fw-bold text-dark mt-1"><%= user.tong_ngay_phep - user.ngay_phep_da_dung %> <span class="fs-6 text-muted fw-medium">ngày</span></div>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="text-muted small ps-3 mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                        <li class="mb-2">Đơn xin nghỉ từ <strong>3 ngày trở lên</strong> cần nộp trước ít nhất 01 tuần để quản lý sắp xếp.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">Hãy chắc chắn người nhận bàn giao đã <span class="text-dark fw-bold">đồng ý tiếp nhận</span> công việc của bạn.</li>
                        <li>Đơn Nghỉ ốm cần bổ sung giấy khám sức khỏe cho HR ngay sau khi đi làm lại.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>